# Trivy suppressions — CRITICAL/HIGH Debian trixie CVEs with NO fix available
# (verified against the Trivy DB on 2026-08-30; the CI gate runs with
# ignore-unfixed=false, so deferred CVEs need an explicit, justified waiver).
#
# All six live in OS packages the conversion runtime never invokes:
#   - gzip binary: unused (PDF/DOCX handling is pure Python via PyMuPDF).
#   - libacl1 / libncursesw6 / libtinfo6: not linked by any Python extension
#     in the image.
#   - libsqlite3-0: ships with Python stdlib support, but the service talks
#     to Postgres only (compose contract); no sqlite database is opened.
#
# Housekeeping: when Debian ships a fix for any of these, remove the line —
# the gate then enforces the patched version automatically.
